                "referenceInfo": {
                    "anatomy": "Bronchioles: Smooth muscle constriction narrows the airway.",
                    "physiology": "Air trapping leads to hyperinflation. Increased intrathoracic pressure can eventually decrease venous return (pulsus paradoxus). Fatigue leads to CO2 retention.",
